{
    "title": "AI Video Generator -Dream Face",
    "description": "DreamFace is a photo animation app!\r\nGenerate stunning videos with one click using AI!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Make your photos sing and dance with one click!\r\n\u2022 Create free text-to-speech with one click!\r\n\u2022 Create stunning avatars with one click!\r\n\u2022 Get enhanced, noise-free, clear, HD-quality pictures with one click!\r\n \r\nNew Feature\r\n\u3010Dynamic Avatar\u3011\r\nFirst upload a recorded video of a character speaking.\r\nYou can change the speech content of the characters in the original video by entering copywriting or uploading audio to make the video presentation more natural and realistic.\r\n1. Let American singers speak Chinese, change male voices into female voices, etc.\r\n2. Video translation,Recorded in one language, released in over 20 languages\r\n\r\n\u3010Talking Avatar\u3011 text to speech--lip sync\r\nUsing the AI video generator, turn still images into speaking digital people in seconds with the DreamFace app.\r\n* Choose a digital person: Tailor your avatars with a face that matches your vision. Choose an existing photorealistic or illustrated face from the built-in library or upload an image of your own from your photo roll and use DreamFace\u2019s AI video generator to bring it to life. \r\n* Create Anywhere You Go: With DreamFace\u2019s AI video generator, the power of Text-to-video animation is now in the palm of your hand.\r\n* AI Video Magic: Your creative companion transforms text and images into videos with talking avatars.\r\n* Instant Animation: AI brings your avatars to life with videos, making them shine with charisma and charm.\r\n* Personalize Speech: Customize your AI avatar's voice effortlessly. Upload voice recordings, or use text-to-speech to determine what you want your digital person to say.\r\n\r\nThe Photo Animator app allows you to bring your photos to life with lip sync and face animation. With features like Talkr, you can turn a regular photo into a talking photo, and even create a singing picture that adds a whole new dimension to your memories.\r\n\r\n\u3010Face Dance Free\u3011-singing picture\r\n- Just upload a photo, pick your favorite song, and make your photo sing to it!\r\n- Make your boss dance to a hilarious song and chuckle with colleagues\r\n- Say your baby's first words\r\n- Let your pet speak up\r\n\r\nTURN FRIENDS INTO MEMES \r\nUpload a picture of a friend and make it...\r\n- SING your favorite song\r\n- DANCE to trending beats (and yes, TikTok challenges too!)\r\n\r\nKEEP UP WITH TRENDS & GO VIRAL\r\n-We add new templates every day; check in once a day to try new animations on your favorite selfies!\r\n-Experience the latest and most fun templates on DreamFace. \r\n- Text to speech-AI fake voice/video generate\r\n \r\n\u3010AI art generator\u3011 \r\nOne click takes you to the dream of the two-dimensional anime world!\r\nAI technology will quickly generate digital works of art in seconds.  DreamFace provides a wide range of art styles for you to choose from, such as pure mixed, sexy cat, cyberpunk, sports boy style and so on, as well as a variety of cartoon styles like devil, anime, romantic couple, etc.\r\n\r\n\u3010Enhance quality\u3011\r\nTurn facial photo into high-definition\r\n- Enhance everyday portraits and selfies to stunning, influencer-style output\r\n\r\nMAKE OLD PHOTO LIVE\r\n- Animate old photos with the Nostalgia mode. \r\n- Bring black & white photos back to life.\r\nAI photo animator free-animated face swap\r\n\r\nIf you know how to improve DreamFace, please write to us: dreamface@newportai.com \r\n\r\n- Join DreamFace Pro members, free to use all features.\r\n- Dreamface Pro Unlimited subscription is billed monthly or annually or weekly at the rate corresponding to the selected plan. \r\n- Subscriptions automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n- Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal.\r\n- Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://dreamfaceapp.com/contact.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://dreamfaceapp.com/privacy.html",
