rrent period, and identify the cost of the renewal.<br>- Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user&#39;s Account Settings after purchase.<br><br>Terms of Service: https://dreamfaceapp.com/contact.html<br>Privacy Policy: https://dreamfaceapp.com/privacy.html",
